#### 3. c1s at G = 0.9: settling points for τ = 3.5 and 5 ms (crossings of θ(n) = τ; θ < τ means ask > n)
  oracle43 bins (median n, θ_exp, θ_fresh): (569, 1.25, 1.18), (741, 1.72, 1.54), (1017, 2.54, 2.29), (1352, 3.94, 3.75), (2048, 8.05, 7.95)
  p34 static caps (n, θ_exp, θ_fresh; truncated minima): (256, -0.83, -0.87), (384, 0.01, 0.19), (512, 0.29, 0.62), (768, 1.87, 2.24), (1024, 3.12, 3.75), (1536, 6.58, 8.14), (2048, 8.87, 10.52)
  τ=3.5 oracle43: fresh map crossings ['1296 (stable)']; expired map crossings ['1248 (stable)']; top-cap θ_exp 8.05 (contracts)
  τ=3.5 p34     : fresh map crossings ['981 (stable)']; expired map crossings ['1080 (stable)']; top-cap θ_exp 8.87 (contracts)
  τ=5.0 oracle43: fresh map crossings ['1560 (stable)']; expired map crossings ['1532 (stable)']; top-cap θ_exp 8.05 (contracts)
  τ=5.0 p34     : fresh map crossings ['1169 (stable)']; expired map crossings ['1302 (stable)']; top-cap θ_exp 8.87 (contracts)
  Reading: start-low settles on the fresh-map crossing; start-high (from 2 048, anchor expired) on the expired-map
  crossing. oracle43 has no window below n ≈ 490, so the lower part of either map is p34's.

#### 4. qsp_us against b0
  qsp_us = P90 − P50 (nearest rank) of the path's last L = 256 RTT samples, read at the [DIAG] tick:
    src/scheduler/path.rs:821-823 cand_quantile = monitor::quantile::nearest_rank; :848-855 rtt_qspread_us =
    cand_quantile(sorted rtt_win, 0.90) − cand_quantile(.., 0.50); :867-869 count = rtt_win.len();
    src/scheduler/copa.rs:190 SIGMA_CAND_WINDOW = 256 (the rtt_win ring, :1003 pops the oldest);
    src/net/diag.rs:679-680 reads it, :724 prints `qsp_us=<µs>/n<fill>` per path. No consumer.
  b0 = Tmin(250 ms window) − RTprop(10 s min) at the smallest caps: a different statistic (a min-to-min gap, not a
  P90−P50 spread). Per-row median over [DIAG] ticks t >= 1 s with a full window (n = 256), mean over rows:
    p27 c2-100 cap 64: p0 qsp 1.96 ms (rows 2)
    p27 c2-100 cap 96: p0 qsp 2.08 ms (rows 2)
    c2-100: b0 (L-weighted) 2.28 ms
    p27 c8-100 cap 128: p0 qsp 1.94 ms (rows 1), p1 qsp 4.90 ms (rows 1)
    p27 c8-100 cap 192: p0 qsp 2.15 ms (rows 2), p1 qsp 5.01 ms (rows 2)
    c8-100: b0 (L-weighted) 2.92 ms
    p34 c1s-400 cap 256: p0 qsp 0.61 ms (rows 3)
    p34 c1s-400 cap 384: p0 qsp 0.94 ms (rows 3)
    c1s-400: b0 (L-weighted) 0.30 ms
    oracle43 c2-100 SL (closed loop, uncapped era): qsp row medians 1.82, 1.77, 1.83 ms
    oracle43 c2-100 SL-B0 (closed loop, uncapped era): qsp row medians 1.66, 1.71, 1.71 ms
    oracle43 c1s-400 SL (closed loop, uncapped era): qsp row medians 0.52, 0.62 ms
